Chapter: CongMismatch

 cong lifts a === b to f a === f b, so both sides must apply the same
 constructor to equal arguments. Refl proves Integer === Integer, so
 cong Refl can only prove f Integer === f Integer. Claiming
 List Integer === List Text must be rejected (CDX2001).

Section: Bad Proof

  bad-cong : (List Integer) === (List Text)
  bad-cong = cong Refl

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "unreachable"
  end
